OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy this
OL,6,Fevening with showery rain pushing
OL,7,Ffurther south becoming rather
OL,8,Fwidespread through the early hours.
OL,9,FRather mild overnight under cloud
OL,10,Fcover with moderate to fresh winds
OL,11,Fparticularly around coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cloudy start to the day with
OL,14,Fbrisk winds, and a risk of showers.
OL,15,FShowers becoming more isolated into
OL,16,Fthe afternoon, with a chance of some
OL,17,Fbrighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
